  {
   "id": "souls-of-chronos-233791@1.5.234.2",
   "gameId": "souls-of-chronos-233791",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.5.234.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-25T05:42:48.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello adventurers of Astra!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are pleased to announce the latest update version 1.5.234.2, which includes some exciting new features and improvements. Here are the highlights of this update:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Firstly, we have added a tutorial on the archive feature, and you can now find save points in the Workshop \"The Dandelion\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And then we have enhanced the operation experience of Nidhogg Long Fang, so attacking with this weapon will not be interrupted by enemies anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lastly, we have adjusted the strengthening route of the Pneumatic Device, which now focuses more on dealing damage to enemies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope that these updates will enrich your gameplay experience and bring you more excitement in your adventures. Thank you for your continued support！",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Development Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "May 25, 2023",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
