  {
   "id": "souls-of-chronos-233791@1.5.231.8",
   "gameId": "souls-of-chronos-233791",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.5.231.8",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-04-05T08:42:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Adventurers of Astella,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here you will find a list of fixes that address the following issues in the update 1.5.231.8:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Introducing Key Rebinding",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now players can personalize their key bindings from \"Check controls\" in Settings, applicable to both keyboard and controller configurations.: Improved Default Key Bindings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Based on community feedback, we have made a few adjustments to the default keybinds to provide an improved gameplay experience.: Fixed Missing/Wrong Quest Indicators",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We have addressed the incorrect or missing quest indicators to avoid confusion when questing.: Increased Interaction Range",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the interaction range of objects and NPCs, now players can interact with objects or NPCs more easily.: Additionally, further optimizations and additional features are under active development at this moment.: Thank you for your continued support!: The Development Team: April 5, 2023",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
