       "text": "Here you will find a list of fixes that address the following issues in the update 1.5.333:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Main Menu UI Redesign.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Combat Mechanics Adjustment for Certain Monsters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have taken into consideration the valuable feedback received from our community regarding the combat system since the game's launch. To enhance the overall combat experience, we have implemented adjustments to the stats and behaviors of certain monsters. For instance, the Earthbore will no longer be able to burrow into the ground once its Chrono energy is depleted, and its burrowing action will no longer evade Time-Stop attacks.: Rest assured that we remain committed to continuously optimizing Souls of Chronos through regular updates in order to provide an even better gameplay experience.We once again thank you for your ongoing support!: The Development Team: Mar. 24, 2023",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
