  {
   "id": "souls-of-chronos-233791@1.5.229.7",
   "gameId": "souls-of-chronos-233791",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.5.229.7",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-15T03:51:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Adventurers of Astella,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here you will find a list of fixes that address the following issues in the update 1.5.229.7:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a borderless windowed mode in the display option;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved Quest Logs so they are easier to read;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved Torii's Status Page, now Torii's two combat styles share the same trinket and snack load-outs;: Buffs for Torii's Floating Leaf-style",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Time-Stop attack will now automatically launch daggers toward the location of the mouse cursor.: For controllers, the daggers will automatically lock onto the nearest enemy;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Full Salvo (Available at Level 12): Now attacks also apply marks of psychoblades;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "“Command: Protect”: Now restores HP for Sid.: We have been hard at work behind the scenes - more tune-ups and contents are under active development. Please stay tuned!: The Development Team: Mar. 15, 2023",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
